  "createmoderntech.ponder.volumetric_display.header": "Displaying the Surrounding Terrain",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.volumetric_display.text_1": "The Volumetric Display reads the surrounding terrain and projects a hologram",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.volumetric_display.text_2": "The faster the input RPM, the more geometry the hologram will show",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.volumetric_display.text_3": "Lenses can be placed on top to magnify or zoom the projection",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.volumetric_display.text_4": "A lens setup can be extended using lens extensions",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.volumetric_display.text_5": "A lens at the bottom will scale the projection down by the strength",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.volumetric_display.text_6": "A lens at the top will scale the projection up by the strength",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.volumetric_display.text_7": "Instead of regular shafts, volumetric shafts can be used",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.volumetric_display.text_8": "Controllers can be attached anywhere on the shaft column to manipulate the projection",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.volumetric_display.text_9": "Yaw rotates the projection horizontally",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.volumetric_display.text_10": "Pitch tilts the projection forward and back",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.volumetric_display.text_11": "Pan X shifts the sampled area east or west",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.volumetric_display.text_12": "Pan Z shifts the sampled area east or west",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.volumetric_display.text_13": "Each controller's shaft speed determines how fast the parameter changes",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.lens_extensions.header": "Using Different Lens Extensions",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.lens_extensions.text_1": "Instead of regular lens extensions, special ones can be used",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.lens_extensions.text_2": "The first of these special extensions is the telephoto extension",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.lens_extensions.text_3": "It offsets the projection by 0.5 blocks per extension",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.lens_extensions.text_4": "Next up is the light boost filter",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.lens_extensions.text_5": "It will boost the opacity of the projection by 20 percent",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.lens_extensions.text_6": "Finally, color filters can be used to tune the color of the projection",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.lens_extensions.text_7": "There are...",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.lens_extensions.text_8": "Lime...",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.lens_extensions.text_9": "Red...",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.lens_extensions.text_10": "Purple...",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.lens_extensions.text_11": "And white filters",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.lens_extensions.text_12": "Color filters can be mixed to create many different color combinations",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.beacon_controller.header": "Using The Beacon Controller",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.beacon_controller.text_1": "The beacon controller attaches to a volumetric shaft",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.beacon_controller.text_2": "When powered from the top, a beacon will be placed in the volume",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.beacon_controller.text_3": "If the bottom is powered when a beacon is not hovered, nothing happens",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.beacon_controller.text_4": "However, if a beacon is hovered, powering the bottom of the beacon controller...",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.beacon_controller.text_5": "...will create a beacon compass",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.beacon_controller.text_6": "This compass can be extracted by something like a mechanical arm",
  "createmoderntech.ponder.beacon_controller.text_7": "The compass will then point to the selected beacon"
}
